    "What are you doing right now?": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:112"
    },
    "What that buys: the question «what was service level by chain in July» turns into SQL written by {b}the engine, from your own formula{b_}, and that SQL is shown before any number appears. The model here picks the cut, it does not do the counting: cell values never enter a request to a model.": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:363"
    },
    "What travels into the request is the structure and a few example rows, never the whole extract. Commercial and personal data are not sent to a model — that is a platform rule, not a recommendation.": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:146"
    },
    "When a check looked at part of the rows, the platform says so — «sampled», not a silent «all clear».": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:336"
    },
    "When a run is taken by another analyst, the platform says by whom and for how long instead of silently losing the calculation.": {
